# SPA fallback.
#
# React Router owns /orders/SAL-ORD-2026-00106 and every other deep link, but
# no such file exists on disk. Without this, opening one directly — or hitting
# refresh on it — returns 404 from the static host and the app never loads.
#
# 200 rather than 301: the URL must stay as typed so the router can read it.
#
# /api, /private and /files are handled by Pages Functions, which are matched
# before this rule, so they are not swallowed by it.
